[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 1 | `driver` | `y == 0`, any `x` (tested with `x` = 0, 1, -1, 7, -7, `INT_MAX`, `INT_MIN`, and randomized) — `idiv` divide-by-zero | process killed by **SIGFPE (signal 8)**; **no** stdout output (the `printf` is never reached); no normal return, so no exit code |
