[49m[38;5;10m+      1[0m:[38;5;10m[49m # CONFIGS.md — Configuration-surface table
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      2[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      3[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## How this table was derived
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      4[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      5[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The C has no runtime options, no flags, no modes, no `#ifdef`, no global state
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      6[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and no setters:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m grep -nE '#ifdef|#if |#ifndef|static|extern|global|_Bool|flag|mode|option|set[A-Z_]' \
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m      c_src/src/driver.c c_src/include/driver.h
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m matches only the header's `#ifndef DRIVER_H_` include guard. The public API is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m one entry point, `void driver(int, int)`, which is simultaneously the *lowest*
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m level entry point and the only one — there are no convenience wrappers to skip
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m past and no deeper layer to reach.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m So the configuration axes are entirely in the **input shape**, i.e. the operand
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m pairs that `div()` and `printf("%d")` treat differently. Derived from the two
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m operations the C delegates to:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 1 — sign combination** (`idiv` truncates toward zero, and C99 fixes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `rem` to take the sign of the *numerator*; all four sign quadrants are distinct
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m code paths in the sense that they produce different sign patterns in the output,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and are the classic place a translation using floor-division diverges):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `(+,+)`, `(+,-)`, `(-,+)`, `(-,-)`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 2 — magnitude relation** (determines whether the quotient is zero):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `|x| < |y|`, `|x| == |y|`, `|x| > |y|`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 3 — divisibility** (determines whether the remainder is zero, and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m whether the sign-of-remainder rule is even observable — it is invisible when
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `rem == 0`, which is why exact and inexact must be separate rows):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `x % y == 0` vs `x % y != 0`.
